      "side": 0,
      "message": "Done, thanks for pointing that out! Updated reset() to check GrTextureTypeHasRestrictedSampling(backendFormat.textureType()):\n- For restricted textures (kRectangle / kExternal), it constructs GrSamplerState(WrapMode::kClamp, samplerState.filter(), MipmapMode::kNone), clamping wrap modes and disabling mipmaps and anisotropic filtering (preserving kNearest/kLinear).\n- Otherwise, it copy-assigns fSamplerState \u003d samplerState to preserve fMaxAniso and the rest of the sampler state.\n\nPTAL!",
